[2026-03-14T21:11:22.657Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018WWq7zXkHJAu1SUeGgHdW6","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me compile a comprehensive summary with all the findings:\n\n## Comprehensive Sidebar Test Documentation\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the repository, here is the complete information you need for writing Playwright tests about the Sidebar component:\n\n### 1. App Directory Structure\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`\n- **Key directories**:\n  - `/src/components/` - UI components including Sidebar components\n  - `/src/pages/` - Page components\n  - `/src/slices/` - Redux state management\n  - `/netlify/functions/` - Backend API functions\n  - `/tests/` - Playwright test files\n  - `/docs/` - Test specifications (tests.md)\n  - `/scripts/` - Seed and deployment scripts\n\n### 2. Test Spec & Documentation Files\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n  - This comprehensive document contains all Sidebar test specifications (lines 113-280 for Sidebar, SidebarCollapse)\n  - Includes expected behaviors, data conditions, and navigation patterns\n  - Lists all 28+ Sidebar-related tests with detailed requirements\n\n### 3. Existing Test Files & Patterns\nAll test files are in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n- **sidebar.spec.ts** (14,881 bytes) - Contains 26 Sidebar tests with helper functions\n- **login.spec.ts** (8,206 bytes) - Login form tests (reference for patterns)\n- **signup.spec.ts** (8,477 bytes) - Sign up form tests (reference for patterns)\n\n**Key Test Patterns**:\n- Uses helper functions like `loginAsAlice()`, `getTeams()`, `getNotifications()`\n- Authenticates via localStorage with session_token\n- Uses API calls to get test data (teams, notifications)\n- Uses `getByTestId()` for element selection\n- Includes timeout configurations (30000ms for page loads, 10000ms for expectations)\n- Uses `.slow()` for tests taking longer time\n\n### 4. Sidebar Component Source Code\n\n**Main component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n\n**Key data-testid values used in component**:\n- `sidebar` - main aside container\n- `sidebar-workspace-name` - workspace header link\n- `sidebar-nav` - navigation container\n- `sidebar-link-my-issues` - My Issues link\n- `sidebar-link-inbox` - Inbox link\n- `sidebar-inbox-badge` - notification count badge\n- `sidebar-teams-section` - teams container\n- `sidebar-team-${teamId}` - individual team container\n- `sidebar-team-header-${teamId}` - team header button\n- `sidebar-team-links-${teamId}` - team links container\n- `sidebar-link-team-issues-${teamId}` - Issues link for team\n- `sidebar-link-team-cycles-${teamId}` - Active Cycle link for team\n- `sidebar-link-team-projects-${teamId}` - Projects link for team\n- `sidebar-link-team-views-${teamId}` - Views link for team\n- `sidebar-workspace-section` - workspace section\n- `sidebar-link-all-projects` - All Projects link\n- `sidebar-link-all-teams` - All Teams link\n- `sidebar-link-members` - Members link\n- `sidebar-link-labels` - Labels link\n- `sidebar-link-settings` - Settings link\n\n**SidebarCollapse component**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SidebarCollapse.tsx`\n- `sidebar-collapse-toggle` - collapse/expand button\n\n**CSS classes for styling**:\n- `.sidebar` - main container (width: 240px)\n- `.sidebar-collapsed` - collapsed state (width: 48px)\n- `.sidebar-link-active` - active navigation link styling\n\n### 5. Playwright Configuration\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000 (test timeout)\n- expect.timeout: 10000 (assertion timeout)\n- baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888'\n- actionTimeout: 15000\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: true\n- retries: 0\n```\n\n### 6. Route Paths\nFrom `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/App.tsx`:\n\n**Authenticated routes** (require session_token):\n- `/my-issues` - My Issues page\n- `/inbox` - Inbox/notifications\n- `/team/:teamId/issues` - Team-specific issues\n- `/team/:teamId/cycles` - Team active cycle\n- `/issue/:issueId` - Issue detail page\n- `/projects` - All projects\n- `/project/:projectId` - Project detail\n- `/settings` - Settings root\n- `/settings/members` - Workspace members\n- `/settings/teams` - All teams management\n- `/settings/labels` - Labels management\n\n**Auth-only routes** (no sidebar):\n- `/login` - Login page\n- `/signup` - Sign up page\n\n### 7. Seed Data & Test Helpers\n\n**Seed data file**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Key seeded data**:\n- **Workspace**: \"Acme Corp\"\n- **Teams**: \n  - Engineering (identifier: \"ENG\")\n  - Design (identifier: \"DES\")\n- **Test user**: alice@acme.com with password \"password123\" (role: admin)\n- **Other users**: bob@acme.com, carol@acme.com (both members)\n- **Notifications for Alice**: 3 unread notifications in seed data\n- **Issues**: 8 Engineering issues + 3 Design issues with various statuses and assignments\n- **Labels**: Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n- **Project**: \"V2 Launch\" (in_progress)\n- **Cycle**: \"Sprint 12\" (active, Engineering team)\n\n**Helper functions** (from existing test files):\n\n```typescript\n// Authentication\nasync function loginAsAlice(baseURL: string): Promise<string>\nasync function authenticatePage(page: any, baseURL: string): Promise<string>\n\n// Teams & Data\nasync function getTeams(baseURL: string, token: string)\nasync function getNotifications(baseURL: string, token: string)\nasync function markNotificationRead(baseURL: string, token: string, notificationId: string)\n```\n\n### 8. Redux State Management\n\n**Store location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/store.ts`\n\n**Key slices for Sidebar**:\n- `auth` - Authentication state (token, user)\n- `ui` - UI state (contains `sidebarCollapsed` boolean)\n- `teams` - Teams list state\n- `workspace` - Workspace state (name)\n- `notifications` - Notifications state (u